WEBVTT

00:04.920 --> 00:05.670
Huh?!

00:06.420 --> 00:08.170
Oh, come on. Now what?!

00:08.880 --> 00:11.080
Lady Kobayashi. Lord Endo.

00:14.210 --> 00:15.210
Lirenna?!

00:15.210 --> 00:18.250
It was Kuon. Kuon kidnapped your sister.

00:18.500 --> 00:19.500
Kuon did?!

00:19.830 --> 00:23.250
As a vessel for Eve's soul, I suspect.

00:24.130 --> 00:26.670
"A vessel for Eve's soul"?

00:27.460 --> 00:28.880
Where's my sister?!

00:28.880 --> 00:29.830
And Kuon?!

00:32.710 --> 00:37.080
I have just blessed you both with my divine favor.

00:37.580 --> 00:39.130
Her voice just came down from above!

00:39.130 --> 00:41.040
Straight into our heads!

00:41.790 --> 00:44.330
This must have been what it was like for Sieg and them.

00:45.210 --> 00:51.540
Lady Kobayashi, Lord Endo, I will tell you
where you can find your sister.

00:51.540 --> 00:53.040
What? You can tell?!

00:53.040 --> 01:01.540
Yes. Your sister is northeast of your location,
1,223 meters away in the measurements of your world.

01:01.790 --> 01:03.420
And now they're headed further north,

01:04.830 --> 01:07.580
towards a large building in that direction.

01:06.880 --> 01:07.580
<b>Wakabayama</b>

01:06.880 --> 01:07.580
<b>University</b>

01:08.630 --> 01:09.540
This place...

01:09.540 --> 01:10.250
What?

01:11.080 --> 01:14.080
<b>Wakabayama</b>

01:11.080 --> 01:14.080
<b>University</b>

01:11.830 --> 01:13.330
Wakabayama University!

01:14.330 --> 01:15.790
Wait, that's my sister's...

01:15.790 --> 01:17.580
...and Kirise Kuon's school!

01:24.000 --> 01:27.790
<b>The Best Happy End to End All Happy Ends!</b>

01:35.540 --> 01:42.710
Once you two get to Kuon, I'll rip his soul away from
the human he's possessing and take him back with me!

01:42.960 --> 01:45.580
Kuon... Why would he take Chiyono?

01:45.920 --> 01:50.790
I believe it's an act of desperation, now that
he knows I've been restored as a goddess.

01:51.130 --> 01:52.580
"An act of desperation"?

01:52.960 --> 01:55.880
Yes. He's always been that way.

01:56.170 --> 02:01.040
He acts on his emotions and doesn't think
about consequences. He's such an incredible fool.

02:01.500 --> 02:04.630
That's messed up, even by human standards.

02:05.830 --> 02:07.500
Kuon's very close by.

02:10.040 --> 02:11.290
Hey, over there!

02:11.290 --> 02:12.040
Huh?

02:13.040 --> 02:13.960
A greenhouse?

02:13.960 --> 02:15.830
Look, there's something inside!

02:17.500 --> 02:18.880
What is that?

02:19.290 --> 02:20.420
Do you think that's them?

02:27.790 --> 02:28.920
It won't be long now.

02:29.500 --> 02:31.420
Let's not do this, Kuon.

02:31.420 --> 02:32.330
Silence.

02:32.670 --> 02:35.540
But kidnapping is a serious crime!

02:36.960 --> 02:40.500
Why should a god like me care
about some mortal crime?

02:41.000 --> 02:42.790
Kuon, I...

02:42.790 --> 02:43.710
Sis!

02:45.750 --> 02:46.710
So you came.

02:47.000 --> 02:50.710
You're the worst! Why would a god
go and kidnap my sister?!

02:50.710 --> 02:51.960
But it's over for you now!

02:52.580 --> 02:53.460
Lirenna!

02:57.000 --> 02:58.460
Leave it to me.

03:07.920 --> 03:08.460
Oh!

03:09.500 --> 03:10.580
Lady Lirenna?

03:10.830 --> 03:12.250
I can't see them anymore.

03:12.250 --> 03:13.000
What?!

03:13.210 --> 03:14.500
What do you mean?

03:15.130 --> 03:16.460
Did Kuon do something?

03:18.080 --> 03:19.630
It seems he put up a barrier.

03:19.960 --> 03:20.880
A barrier?

03:21.790 --> 03:24.040
Lord Endoh... Lady Kobayashee!

03:24.830 --> 03:25.710
Lirenna?!

03:26.420 --> 03:27.750
What's the matter, Lirenna?!

03:28.330 --> 03:30.170
I can't hear her. At all!

03:30.170 --> 03:31.880
Yeah. What happened?

03:33.420 --> 03:37.210
I blocked her out, because she wanted to get in my way.

03:37.540 --> 03:38.460
"Blocked her out"?

03:38.460 --> 03:40.830
I put up a barrier of sorts.

03:41.130 --> 03:41.750
What?!

03:41.960 --> 03:44.960
It was easy enough. I'm a god, after all.

03:47.500 --> 03:53.920
You're wasting your time! Magikoi's locked into
the best happy end to end all happy ends!

03:54.130 --> 04:00.420
Yeah, that's right! The girl you want to bring over here,
Fiene, is in a completely loving relationship with Bal!

04:00.580 --> 04:03.460
Okay. But so what?

04:03.460 --> 04:04.420
What do you mean?

04:11.130 --> 04:12.210
I can't move!

04:14.170 --> 04:19.330
So, Shihono Kobayashi. I see
your heart is quite dark and twisted.

04:20.540 --> 04:22.920
It's the same shade of jealousy as mine.

04:23.670 --> 04:27.170
I see. You're jealous of this sister of yours.

04:27.710 --> 04:29.000
Y-you're wrong!

04:29.290 --> 04:30.830
Go ahead and admit it.

04:31.420 --> 04:34.290
Accept who you are and you'll feel much better.

04:37.000 --> 04:39.670
I can't believe Kuon had the ability to do this!

04:40.000 --> 04:42.750
Lady Lirenna, please break
the barrier down as fast as possible!

04:42.750 --> 04:44.130
Yes, of course!

04:44.330 --> 04:46.880
But how, though?!

04:46.880 --> 04:47.960
Please calm down!

04:48.580 --> 04:53.960
I have never talked directly with either
Lady Kobayashee or Lord Endoh.

04:54.330 --> 04:57.460
But I know their voices saved me.

04:58.290 --> 05:01.830
Come on, Lieselotte!
Don't give in to the stupid Witch of Yore!

05:01.830 --> 05:04.130
Liese-tan! Stay strong!

05:05.290 --> 05:09.290
Their voices were so kind, and so warm.

05:09.670 --> 05:13.130
If the two of them are in danger,

05:13.540 --> 05:15.790
I would like to help them this time.

05:16.460 --> 05:21.750
But all I can do at the moment is simply pray.

05:23.330 --> 05:24.080
Liese...

05:27.750 --> 05:31.040
Come on. Admit it, Shihono Kobayashi.

05:31.580 --> 05:34.130
Admit to the ugliness of your heart.

05:34.420 --> 05:36.500
My... heart?

05:36.920 --> 05:39.080
Why would you do this to Kobayashi?!

05:39.080 --> 05:42.920
Well, she's capable of linking to the other world.

05:43.210 --> 05:46.080
I've decided to have her do as I say.

05:47.250 --> 05:54.080
That's right. Then I'll capture Eve
and bring her over to this world!

05:54.330 --> 05:55.420
And this time for sure,

05:55.830 --> 05:58.170
I'll make Eve mine, and mine alone!

06:01.580 --> 06:04.670
That woman who heedlessly guided you both to me...!

06:05.250 --> 06:07.170
She's a fool, isn't she?

06:08.830 --> 06:12.540
This wasn't an act of desperation!
It was all part of his plan!

06:13.540 --> 06:15.670
Jealous? Of my sister?

06:16.750 --> 06:18.210
Maybe I am...

06:27.960 --> 06:30.170
Kobayashi. Kobayashi!

06:30.960 --> 06:36.170
Ever since we were little, my sister was always
charming... and pretty...

06:36.630 --> 06:39.580
and everyone fell in love with her alone.

06:44.920 --> 06:47.670
I'm sure Endo does, too.

06:48.420 --> 06:50.460
They looked like they were having so much fun that day.

06:50.880 --> 06:51.830
Like the perfect couple.

06:52.920 --> 06:57.460
I'm no good. My heart's dark and twisted... and ugly!

06:57.710 --> 07:03.000
That's right. Admit it. Your heart is just like mine.

07:05.380 --> 07:06.830
My heart...

07:09.920 --> 07:11.130
and Kuon's...

07:11.710 --> 07:14.130
They're not alike in the slightest!

07:14.130 --> 07:14.880
What?!

07:16.630 --> 07:18.580
Uh... Huh?!

07:19.880 --> 07:20.960
That voice!

07:23.330 --> 07:25.710
They're not alike in the slightest!

07:25.710 --> 07:26.500
Huh?

07:27.500 --> 07:32.420
There is absolutely no reason you should have to listen...

07:33.750 --> 07:35.290
to such malicious nonsense!

07:36.540 --> 07:38.170
Lie...se...

07:39.540 --> 07:40.460
Liese-tan?!

07:43.290 --> 07:43.880
What?!

07:45.960 --> 07:47.000
Kobayashi?

07:51.580 --> 07:53.460
Endo! Liese-tan...

07:53.750 --> 07:55.750
You heard Liese-tan's voice, didn't you?!

07:56.080 --> 07:57.960
Yeah, but why?

07:57.960 --> 07:59.830
Liese-tan! Liese-tan?!

07:59.830 --> 08:01.540
I'm over here.

08:01.540 --> 08:02.170
Huh?

08:02.420 --> 08:03.130
What?!

08:05.170 --> 08:09.920
My name is Lieselotte Riefenstahl. Please call me Liese.

08:09.920 --> 08:10.960
This doll?!

08:11.170 --> 08:15.920
Indeed. O bearers of the kind and
warm voices I heard in my dreams.

08:16.710 --> 08:19.330
Liese? Are you all right, Liese?

08:21.710 --> 08:22.540
Miss Liese...

08:22.880 --> 08:25.920
Actually, it looks as if she's in a deep sleep.

08:26.960 --> 08:30.920
She was in the middle of giving a prayer for the gods...

08:38.040 --> 08:38.790
Liese!

08:39.580 --> 08:41.330
...when she suddenly fell asleep.

08:43.130 --> 08:44.420
But why?

08:44.420 --> 08:48.500
Perhaps part of her soul is over
in Lady Kobayashi's world?

08:50.330 --> 08:52.880
In Lady Kobayashee's world?

08:53.040 --> 08:53.580
Yes.

08:54.670 --> 08:56.670
We are witnessing a miracle.

08:57.920 --> 09:04.290
I was praying for your safety
when I realized I was in this doll.

09:05.250 --> 09:10.960
Liese-tan! We're... we're talking directly
for the first time! I'm so happy!

09:10.960 --> 09:12.210
As am I.

09:12.460 --> 09:14.630
I made this doll myself, actually.

09:14.630 --> 09:20.040
There were no official ones available,
but I really wanted to be with Liese-tan always!

09:20.040 --> 09:22.630
Uh, handmade? You made this?!

09:22.960 --> 09:24.790
That's some talent, Kobayashi!

09:26.330 --> 09:27.580
I'm flattered.

09:27.960 --> 09:31.460
You went to the trouble of making a doll version of me?

09:31.920 --> 09:33.000
Liese-tan...

09:33.000 --> 09:33.630
Hey!

09:33.630 --> 09:34.330
Huh?

09:37.040 --> 09:38.380
Whoops, I forgot about him!

09:38.380 --> 09:39.080
Kuon...

09:39.080 --> 09:42.000
What do you mean "hey," you malevolent wretch?

09:42.170 --> 09:43.790
"M-malevolent wretch"?!

09:44.210 --> 09:45.500
I'm a god, you know!

09:45.830 --> 09:48.290
God or not, you're definitely malevolent.

09:48.290 --> 09:53.250
Truly an evil god. You tried to manipulate
a human's uncertainties to control her!

09:53.250 --> 09:54.000
Wow.

09:54.420 --> 09:55.170
Quiet!

09:55.170 --> 09:56.630
No, I will not be quiet!

09:56.630 --> 10:00.000
I've decided to always say what I want going forward!

10:00.960 --> 10:03.960
Lord Endoh, you should do the same!

10:03.960 --> 10:05.040
M-me?!

10:05.040 --> 10:08.960
Yes! Lady Kobayashee's uncertainties
are partly due to you!

10:08.960 --> 10:09.540
Huh?!

10:09.830 --> 10:12.000
I'm part of the cause?

10:12.330 --> 10:18.330
I was saved because Sieg put
his feelings for me into actual words.

10:18.790 --> 10:21.540
I want you to think so, and believe in me.

10:22.460 --> 10:23.380
I love you.

10:24.250 --> 10:24.920
Oh...

10:27.750 --> 10:30.500
Lord Endoh! I urge you to do the same!

10:30.500 --> 10:32.710
Huh?! Well...

10:33.540 --> 10:34.420
I...

10:35.670 --> 10:38.670
Let's make sure we give Liese-tan a happy ending!

10:38.830 --> 10:41.500
With the power of our commentary and analysis!

11:03.130 --> 11:04.040
Endo?

11:05.380 --> 11:08.210
Shihono Kobayashi, I'm...

11:10.380 --> 11:11.420
in love with you!

11:12.460 --> 11:13.290
Huh?

11:13.710 --> 11:16.420
When I lost baseball, you saved me.

11:16.830 --> 11:23.630
Ever since I decided to join the Broadcasting Club,
I've always, always been in love with you!

11:26.170 --> 11:31.170
M-me too. Endo, I love you, too.

11:34.710 --> 11:35.750
Thanks.

11:35.750 --> 11:37.080
No, thank you.

11:37.080 --> 11:39.210
Uh, do you wanna go out, then?

11:39.670 --> 11:40.580
I do!

11:40.580 --> 11:41.630
Yes!

11:43.500 --> 11:44.920
Uh, hello?

11:46.000 --> 11:48.330
So you're in love with each other too?

11:48.960 --> 11:50.710
What is it with you humans?

11:51.250 --> 11:52.420
I should end you all!

11:55.920 --> 11:56.630
Hmm?

11:57.710 --> 11:58.750
Endo...

12:00.040 --> 12:03.000
Our feelings are mutual because
we put in hard, honest effort into it!

12:03.170 --> 12:03.920
Huh?

12:04.250 --> 12:11.670
I never murdered a rival or made a loved one suffer,
or did horrible things to someone else, unlike you!

12:11.670 --> 12:12.540
What's that?!

12:12.790 --> 12:18.170
Besides, when you love someone,
you usually put their happiness first and foremost!

12:18.330 --> 12:23.790
But all you care about is your own happiness, and
you just want to make someone your own, like an object!

12:24.460 --> 12:28.130
You aren't devoted, or selfless, or endearing!

12:28.580 --> 12:29.750
You have none of that!

12:29.750 --> 12:31.670
Silence, silence, silence!

12:32.080 --> 12:35.920
Fiene said she fell for Baldur's
stupidly earnest love for her,

12:35.920 --> 12:41.040
and his rugged hands that prove how much
effort he has put into his years of training.

12:41.460 --> 12:46.880
All things you haven't a shred of,
you malevolent, malicious, selfish lout!

12:46.880 --> 12:51.040
Stop... Stop. Stop!

12:51.540 --> 12:53.960
All of you!

13:01.460 --> 13:02.500
The barrier!

13:05.710 --> 13:06.580
That's it.

13:07.250 --> 13:10.920
I've had... enough of you all!

13:25.750 --> 13:26.330
Huh?

13:26.750 --> 13:27.500
Uh?!

13:27.880 --> 13:28.580
What?!

13:30.000 --> 13:33.000
I've got you...

13:32.080 --> 13:33.000
Lirenna!

13:33.290 --> 13:34.250
...now!

13:35.710 --> 13:40.080
All right, Kuon. It's time to give up and come back to me!

13:42.880 --> 13:44.540
Noooo!

13:44.540 --> 13:45.380
There!

13:49.710 --> 13:50.670
Lady Lirenna!

13:50.670 --> 13:52.330
You got rid of the barrier!

13:52.710 --> 13:56.330
And you ripped Kuon's soul away from Kirise Kuon?

13:56.330 --> 14:01.920
Yes! All thanks to Lady Kobayashi and Lord Endo,
as well as you, Lady Lieselotte!

14:03.330 --> 14:03.880
Oh!

14:04.790 --> 14:06.130
Kuon! He's still there?!

14:13.540 --> 14:16.000
Kuon. He's gone.

14:16.540 --> 14:18.710
His wife ripped him away from you!

14:18.710 --> 14:21.420
Lirenna, what are you going to do about Kuon?

14:21.420 --> 14:27.380
We were one to begin with. I'll seal him away
inside of me and have him enter a long sleep.

14:27.380 --> 14:33.670
With the belief that someday in the furthest reaches
of time, his malevolence might eventually disappear.

14:37.670 --> 14:38.500
Oh, that's right!

14:38.500 --> 14:38.960
Huh?

14:38.960 --> 14:40.040
Sis!

14:40.040 --> 14:40.670
Oh!

14:41.330 --> 14:44.710
Not to worry. She'll come to shortly.

14:45.040 --> 14:47.420
She won't remember anything about Kuon.

14:47.750 --> 14:48.960
Thank goodness!

14:49.380 --> 14:52.580
I'm so sorry. What Kuon did was awful.

14:52.960 --> 14:55.130
But I couldn't stop him.

14:55.130 --> 14:57.460
Well, I mean, how could you have stopped him?

14:57.920 --> 15:02.580
He was definitely awful, but he did save my life.

15:02.920 --> 15:03.540
Huh?

15:03.830 --> 15:07.920
When I was in elementary school, I was sick
and they said I didn't have long to live.

15:09.040 --> 15:11.920
But he cured me of that illness.

15:12.580 --> 15:16.460
Well, maybe he just wanted
to take advantage of me, but still.

15:16.880 --> 15:18.130
I see...

15:18.130 --> 15:18.880
Huh.

15:19.710 --> 15:24.710
We're almost out of time.
Both Lady Lieselotte and I must get back.

15:25.960 --> 15:28.920
Lady Kobayashee, I'm so glad to have met you.

15:29.170 --> 15:30.250
Liese-tan...

15:31.210 --> 15:32.880
Please don't cry.

15:32.880 --> 15:37.210
But I finally got to talk to you,
and we have to say goodbye already...!

15:37.710 --> 15:42.380
Both Sieg and I will give thanks
to the two of you everyday.

15:42.750 --> 15:46.500
I hope both of you will remember us sometimes.

15:46.880 --> 15:51.580
Of course we will! Liese-tan,
you're my precious... my precious...

15:52.880 --> 15:55.080
Yes, likewise.

16:01.750 --> 16:05.000
Lady Kobayashi, Lord Endo, please be well.

16:05.130 --> 16:07.080
You too, Lirenna and Liese-tan!

16:07.080 --> 16:08.880
Say hi to Sieg and everyone for us!

16:08.880 --> 16:11.790
Yes. Thank you so much.

16:12.000 --> 16:14.250
We just want you all to be happy.

16:14.880 --> 16:17.290
I bid you well. Goodbye!

16:18.580 --> 16:19.460
Goodbye!

16:19.670 --> 16:20.540
Goodbye!

16:31.830 --> 16:33.250
They really went back, huh?

16:33.250 --> 16:34.040
Yeah.

16:35.380 --> 16:38.330
Kirise Kuon apologized repeatedly as he left,

16:39.380 --> 16:41.290
and Kobayashi's sister woke up without a problem.

16:42.250 --> 16:46.920
She seemed puzzled as to
why she was in the greenhouse,

16:42.830 --> 16:46.920
Sis! You had me so worried!

16:48.040 --> 16:50.790
but we managed to explain it away somehow...

16:52.000 --> 16:52.880
I think?

16:58.790 --> 17:00.420
<b>Love Me</b>

16:58.790 --> 17:00.420
<b>Magically!</b>

17:00.420 --> 17:02.710
<b>The Royal Academy of Magic-Courtyard</b>

17:00.960 --> 17:01.500
Sieg!

17:01.790 --> 17:02.710
Sieg!

17:03.750 --> 17:05.460
Lord Endoh and Lady Kobayashee!

17:05.460 --> 17:08.290
Oh, thank goodness!

17:08.290 --> 17:09.830
We're still connected!

17:09.830 --> 17:13.210
Sieg, the final boss Lirenna has
been restored as a goddess

17:13.460 --> 17:17.420
and the secret boss Kuon has been sealed away,
bringing this game to a proper end.

17:17.420 --> 17:21.750
Which means our roles as commentator
and analyst are over as well.

17:22.000 --> 17:25.330
Um, "over"? What do you mean by that?

17:25.880 --> 17:30.040
We think this is the last time our voices
will reach you through the game.

17:32.170 --> 17:34.580
We're really so glad everyone ended up happy.

17:34.580 --> 17:36.380
And that no one had to die.

17:36.670 --> 17:40.920
This is the best happy end to end
all happy ends that we hoped for.

17:41.290 --> 17:45.290
All that is thanks to you,
Lord Endoh and Lady Kobayashee.

17:45.830 --> 17:47.080
We are so obliged to you!

17:47.630 --> 17:49.330
Are we in the presence of the gods?

17:49.710 --> 17:50.500
Yes.

17:50.500 --> 17:53.000
<b>The Royal Academy of Magic-Courtyard</b>

17:50.500 --> 17:53.000
<b>Siegwald</b>

17:50.500 --> 17:53.000
<b>Yes.</b>

17:53.290 --> 17:55.630
Just look at those amazing smiles!

17:57.130 --> 18:00.250
<b>Divine gods,</b>

17:57.380 --> 18:00.250
<b>we hardly deserve the honor of your words.</b>

17:58.960 --> 18:03.670
Hey Sieg, now that we've fulfilled our roles,
and we're not gods anymore...

18:03.670 --> 18:05.580
and we're around the same age, to boot.

18:05.710 --> 18:08.000
Could you stop with all the formal language?

18:08.170 --> 18:10.290
Huh? Oh, but I...

18:10.290 --> 18:11.500
Yeah, no more of that!

18:11.500 --> 18:14.250
A-all right, as you wish-

18:14.500 --> 18:16.580
Uh, I mean, okay.

18:16.580 --> 18:19.080
Um... E-En...

18:19.460 --> 18:21.670
It's Endo. And Kobayashi!

18:22.170 --> 18:24.790
E-Endo! And Kobayashi!

18:24.920 --> 18:26.290
Okay, Sieg!

18:26.290 --> 18:27.790
That's sounding great!

18:27.790 --> 18:29.170
Thank you so very...

18:29.580 --> 18:30.460
Thanks!

18:32.040 --> 18:35.040
<b>Siegwald</b>

18:32.040 --> 18:35.040
<b>Thank you so very… Thanks!</b>

18:36.500 --> 18:38.920
Hmm, it looks like this is it.

18:39.080 --> 18:39.790
Huh?

18:39.790 --> 18:43.670
I hope we might get to connect again,
somehow or the other.

18:44.500 --> 18:47.000
But I wouldn't count on it.

18:47.000 --> 18:48.420
This is it, Liese-tan.

18:48.790 --> 18:50.960
Endo! Kobayashi!

18:51.460 --> 18:53.250
This is really goodbye.

18:53.790 --> 18:56.040
Or rather, see you again, I guess?

18:56.420 --> 18:57.920
We're friends, after all.

18:58.960 --> 18:59.960
Friends?

19:00.790 --> 19:05.330
You're right. It's goodbye for now,
but let us meet again someday!

19:05.330 --> 19:06.630
Yeah, see you!

19:07.540 --> 19:08.460
See you!

19:15.290 --> 19:16.960
<b>Love Me</b>

19:15.290 --> 19:16.960
<b>Magically!</b>

19:32.040 --> 19:34.080
I can't hear anything anymore.

19:35.580 --> 19:39.830
Thank you, Endo the Running Commentator
and Kobayashi the Expert Analyst.

19:39.830 --> 19:43.670
I swear my undying devotion to
the both of you, as long as I live.

19:58.630 --> 20:01.170
And so the seasons passed, and it is now spring.

20:01.630 --> 20:05.580
Today is finally the day Liese and I are to be married.

20:09.580 --> 20:11.250
Oh. Wow, how beautiful!

20:13.000 --> 20:14.420
You're practically a goddess!

20:14.420 --> 20:17.000
The most beautiful in all the world!

20:17.790 --> 20:22.000
I am to become the bride of
the kingdom's crown prince today!

20:22.000 --> 20:26.170
It's only natural that I strive to look
as beautiful as humanly possible!

20:27.710 --> 20:33.130
But "goddess"? "The most beautiful in all the world"?
Why would you go and say such things?

20:33.380 --> 20:37.420
Goodness Sieg. I pray, do not tease me like that.

20:38.250 --> 20:42.290
My Liese is so irresistibly cute I don't know what to do!

20:42.880 --> 20:44.790
My congratulations!

20:44.790 --> 20:45.500
Huh?

20:46.210 --> 20:48.790
Oh! Lady Lirenna!

20:49.000 --> 20:50.130
Lady Lirenna!

20:50.750 --> 20:52.040
Please don't surprise us like that!

20:53.500 --> 20:56.380
This is nothing to be surprised about!

20:57.250 --> 21:04.080
Feast your eyes on the Creation
Goddess Lirenna's most amazing spell of all time!

21:14.130 --> 21:15.080
What's this?

21:31.380 --> 21:32.790
Liese-tan!

21:35.000 --> 21:38.000
Liese-tan! I finally get to actually meet you!

21:38.000 --> 21:39.250
Lady Kobayashi...

21:39.250 --> 21:40.750
Call me Shihono!

21:41.580 --> 21:42.670
Shihono...

21:43.460 --> 21:47.830
Liese-tan, I'm so, so happy for you!

21:50.790 --> 21:52.580
Thank you, Shihono.

21:54.960 --> 21:55.790
Sieg.

21:56.880 --> 21:57.960
Endo.

22:09.040 --> 22:16.290
By the fates tied together by the merciful Creation
Goddess Lirenna, you are to become husband and wife.

22:16.710 --> 22:20.920
Light a flame when the nights are dark,
start a fire when the mornings are cold,

22:20.920 --> 22:26.670
smile upon each other in happiness, and
take each other's hand in strife as you live together.

22:27.250 --> 22:32.290
Just as the lirene flower blooms eternally,
may your days be filled with eternal happiness.

22:35.580 --> 22:39.130
Ienai kimochi ni kizuite
Please notice these feelings I can't tell you<b></b>

22:39.130 --> 22:45.250
Ibitsu de bukiyou na kotoba de tsutaeru kara
I'll try to make you see with these skewed and clumsy words<b></b>

22:44.170 --> 22:46.380
You look lovely, dear sister!

22:45.500 --> 22:48.420
Kitto kimi ni
Just for you<b></b>

22:46.380 --> 22:47.380
Liese!

22:47.670 --> 22:49.330
Someday, that might be us.

22:49.540 --> 22:50.380
Yes.

22:50.540 --> 22:52.710
I hear you helped them out in the end?

22:52.710 --> 22:56.500
I did. It was a request from
my first love, the Fae Princess, after all.

22:56.500 --> 22:57.130
Huh?

22:57.670 --> 23:00.630
Itsumo gomakashichau yo
I always hide what I mean<b></b>

22:59.750 --> 23:02.130
My sister looks so beautiful!

23:00.630 --> 23:03.040
(Doki doki barenai youni)
(so you don't realize my heart is pounding)<b></b>

23:02.130 --> 23:04.670
She does. Good for you, Lieselotte.

23:03.130 --> 23:08.250
Zenbu mabushisugiru kimi no sei dayo
It's all your fault for being far too stunning<b></b>

23:05.290 --> 23:06.210
Maybe we could also-

23:06.210 --> 23:07.630
Let's not decide just yet.

23:08.500 --> 23:11.290
Kawaiku nante narenaiyo
No way I can be cute<b></b>

23:10.830 --> 23:14.830
Sieg! Lady Lieselotte! May your days be forever happy!

23:11.290 --> 23:13.040
(Datte niawanai desho?)
(I mean, that's not me, is it?)<b></b>

23:13.040 --> 23:15.920
Sono me ni utsuru sora mo
Even the sky reflected in those eyes<b></b>

23:15.920 --> 23:19.210
Massugu mitsumerarenakute
I can't bear to gaze at it straight on<b></b>

23:16.710 --> 23:17.420
Sieg!

23:17.420 --> 23:19.920
Liese-tan, congratulations again!

23:19.210 --> 23:24.540
Uso darake no sekai ni itsumade iru no?
How long am I going to live in this world full of lies?<b></b>

23:20.420 --> 23:22.250
Endo! Kobayashi!

23:22.250 --> 23:24.000
Thank you so much.

23:24.460 --> 23:26.250
Let me vow to the two of you as well.

23:24.540 --> 23:29.460
Kono mamaja nanimo kaerarenai
I'll never manage to change anything at this rate<b></b>

23:26.630 --> 23:29.250
Come what may, I promise I won't ever let Lieselotte...

23:29.630 --> 23:32.170
Sonna no iya dayo
I don't want that to happen<b></b>

23:29.750 --> 23:30.330
Huh?

23:32.170 --> 23:38.290
Moshimo kamisama ga kimochi tsugete kuretatoshitemo
Even if a god were to speak for me and tell you how I feel<b></b>

23:33.540 --> 23:34.630
...out of my grasp!

23:34.960 --> 23:35.920
Sieg.

23:38.290 --> 23:43.580
Itsuka jibun no koe de kimi no koto ga suki dato tsutaetai
Someday, I want to tell you in my own words that I love you<b></b>

23:40.040 --> 23:43.500
And thus, with the blessing from
the three divine entities in attendance,

23:43.790 --> 23:46.250
our wedding would find a proud place

23:43.830 --> 23:52.330
Moshimo ibitsudemo taisetsu na omoi dokoka kiechau mae ni
Even if the words are skewed,<b>
</b>before this precious feeling disappears somewhere<b></b>

23:46.250 --> 23:51.420
written in our kingdom's history as

23:51.420 --> 23:54.790
one of the countless feats and miracles

23:52.830 --> 23:55.540
Yuuki dasu kara
I promise I'll find the courage<b></b>

23:56.250 --> 23:59.630
by Endo the Running Commentator
and Kobayashi the Expert Analyst.
